# Rumtelo E2E (Playwright)

Requires seeded demo accounts (`pnpm db:seed` after migrations + `auth:migrate`).

```bash
# terminals: infra up, backend + application running (seeded demos)
# Practice invite outbox needs memory email + ENABLE_SWAGGER (or local dev)
pnpm --filter @rumtelo/e2e install:browsers
pnpm test:e2e:smoke
pnpm test:e2e:plan
pnpm test:e2e:practice
```

| Persona | Email | Password | Plan / role |
|---------|-------|----------|-------------|
| Basic | basic@rumtelo.com | teloBasic1! | BASIC |
| Plus | plus@rumtelo.com | teloPlus1! | PLUS (seeded Practice invite) |
| Max | max@rumtelo.com | teloMax1! | MAX |
| Practice | practice@rumtelo.com | teloPractice1! | Practice owner |

Override via `APP_URL`, `BACKEND_URL`, `E2E_*_EMAIL`, `E2E_*_PASSWORD`.
